{"program":"class Solution:\n    def findMaxAverage(self, nums: List[int], k: int) -> float:\n        window = sum(nums[:k])\n        best = window\n        for right in range(k, len(nums)):\n            left = right - k\n            window += nums[right] - nums[left]\n            best = max(best, window)\n        return best / k\n\n# CodeLens runs your solution on this input:\nnums = [2, -4, 7, 1, 3, 5]\nk = 3\nresult = Solution().findMaxAverage(nums, k)\nprint(result)\n","trace":{"status":"ok","truncated":false,"codeHash":"e7432a99dd075f907e0d684ea9b2eae9c06190bc1be23a0c354b4545387640ce","steps":[{"index":0,"line":1,"event":"call","functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","depth":0,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}}]},{"index":1,"line":1,"event":"line","functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","depth":0,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}}]},{"index":2,"line":1,"event":"call","functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","depth":1,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}},{"functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","line":1,"locals":{}}]},{"index":3,"line":1,"event":"line","functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","depth":1,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}},{"functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","line":1,"locals":{}}]},{"index":4,"line":2,"event":"line","functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","depth":1,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}},{"functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","line":2,"locals":{}}]},{"index":5,"line":2,"event":"return","functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","depth":1,"locals":{"findMaxAverage":{"__type__":"function"}},"st